      "value": "@{62df020409328244c0bee91a|full_name} \"If you want friends to have it just upload to their account.\" This is a massive security risk and VRChat themselves say not to do this. \"Public is public\" is an old argument that I'm not even willing to entertain anymore as it's been argued so much that you should have clearly seen reasons WHY that's an issue.",
